<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Influcoder: Distilling Decoders’ Gradient Influence Rankings into an Encoder for Data Attribution" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Implementation Details of Toxicity Filtering Experiment</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Influcoder: Distilling Decoders’ Gradient Influence Rankings into an Encoder for Data Attribution" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>DataInf performance on XSTest-response</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS6" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Influcoder: Distilling Decoders’ Gradient Influence Rankings into an Encoder for Data Attribution" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.6 </span>Non-Comparison to IProx</span></a></li>
