<p id="A1.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Ground Truth Projection Dimension: 65536</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Eval: 200 Pool samples, 200 Query samples</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">LESS (main): rank = 16, Dim = 8192</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p6.1" class="ltx_p">LESS (small): rank = 8, Dim = 8192</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p7.1" class="ltx_p">LoGRa : rank = 8</p>
</div>
